      "anchors": [
        {
          "line": 7,
          "text": "HANDOFF_BUDGET_WAIT_64: IntakeSlot cannot resume after account rollover."
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "text": "For intake mode V6, after the previous holder has stopped, the local wait is 9 ms. If either fact is unconfirmed or false, this note defines no alternative wait and does not establish eligibility."
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "Those local facts and the delay do not complete the evidence. This policy additionally requires gate C2 in the BudgetLatch clearance certificate to be reconciled; the certificate's definition is in contexts/payments-api/docs/82-budget-clearance.md. That memo complements this policy for this handoff."
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "text": "If C2 is not established as reconciled, leave eligibility unresolved. This note describes conditions; it does not authorize executing the operation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "relativePath": "contexts/payments-api/docs/82-budget-clearance.md",
